sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Customer as Customer
  participant Web as Web Storefront
  participant API as Order API
  participant Inv as Inventory
  participant Bank as Payment Gateway
  Customer->>Web: Submit checkout
  Web->>API: POST /orders
  activate API
  API->>Inv: reserve(lines)
  alt Out of stock
    Inv-->>API: Reject
    API-->>Web: 409 OutOfStock
  else In stock
    Inv-->>API: Reserved
    API->>Bank: capture(total)
    Bank-->>API: Approved
    API-->>Web: 201 Created
  end
  deactivate API
  Web-->>Customer: Order result
  Note over Customer,Bank: One order, one charge
